<title>JAPAN: Shiseido to buy Carter-Wallace's U.S. facilities.</title>
<headline>Shiseido to buy Carter-Wallace's U.S. facilities.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese cosmetics company Shiseido Co Ltd said on Wednesday that it had agreed to buy U.S. consumer products maker Carter-Wallace Inc's production facilities in New Jersey.</p>
</text>
